=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {z:Windurst Waters (S)} for a cutscene following the completion of {q:When One Man Is Not Enough|When One Man Is Not Enough|When One Man Is Not Enough}.
** **(Optional)** Talk to {n:Dhea Prandoleh} for some text urging you to rush to {z:Sauromugue Champaign}.

!Sauromugue Champaign (S)-map.jpg||Map of Sauromugue Champaign (S)
* Go to {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} and talk to {n:Mham Lahrih} on the upper floor of a fort at (K-9) for a cutscene.
** The fort is right next to the {p:Cavernous Maw} and just a bit north of the {p:Survival Guide}, which will be the fastest route there. Alternatively, you can use the {z:Windurst Waters (S)} {p:Campaign Arbiter|Campaign Arbiters} to warp to {z:Meriphataud Mountains (S)} or {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)}, with the former being somewhat closer.
** (Optional) Speaking with {n:Mham Lahrih} again will result in some flavor text.
* Click on the Abandoned Mineshaft at the bottom of the stairs by Mham Lahrih for another cutscene and to receive a {@k}{k:Signal firecracker}.

=3 Feast for Gnats
* Click the Abandoned Mineshaft again to enter {z:Ghoyu's Reverie} for the **A Feast for Gnats** instance battlefield.
** Up to six players may enter at once as long as they have a {@k}{k:Signal firecracker} or have completed the quest previously. The party leader must have the {@k}{k:Signal firecracker} to take the party in.
* The objective is to destroy the {m:Confederate Belfry}.
** The {m:Confederate Belfry} has approximately 14,000 HP.
** The {m:Confederate Belfry} spawns Quadav after taking damage.
* There are a number of Quadav that are present at the beginning of the fight.
* Eventually, a number of Gigas will spawn as reinforcements.
* Trusts can be summoned.
** If you're lvl 99 with a team of trusts you can confidently win here with ease.
* {p:Romaa Mihgo} and {n:Wildcat Volunteers|Wildcat Volunteer} assist you in this fight.
** If {p:Romaa Mihgo} dies, quest ends in failure.
** You cannot buff {p:Romaa Mihgo} or any of the {n:Wildcat Volunteers|Wildcat Volunteer}, however you can cure them.
* If you fail, you can receive a new Signal Firecracker by talking to {n:Mham Lahrih} on the next Vana'diel day.
* See {p:Discussion|Talk:A Feast for Gnats} for testimonials.

=3 Wrap up
* Talk to {n:Dhea Prandoleh} in {z:Windurst Waters (S)} to complete the quest.

=2 Notes
If you are working on missions then return to {M:In the Name of the Father|In the Name of the Father|In the Name of the Father}.
